error[E0594]: cannot assign to `*artefact`, which is behind a `&` reference
  --> tests/compile_fail/sensor_modifies_the_artefact.rs:17:9
   |
15 |     fn observe(&self, artefact: &Untrusted) -> Verdict {
   |                       -------- this is an immutable reference
